# Working notes, not documentation for players. ROADMAP is dated and written as a diary
# ("took three goes", "confirmed in game"), and TECHNICAL_FINDINGS records how each fault was
# actually chased down. Useful here, and the first thing a reviewer would read if the repo were
# linked from the store listing - which it now is.
#
# PRODUCT_PRINCIPLES and ARCHITECTURE stay: the first is the reason the mod is shaped this way and
# the README links to it, the second is an ordinary engineering overview.
docs/ROADMAP.md
docs/TECHNICAL_FINDINGS.md

# Development workbench: notes, player feedback, backups, logs. Never published.
_dev/

# Local test suite; retained for development, excluded from the public repository.
tests/
